  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&bull; Brand introduction:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">The <strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Wanda Toilet</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42);\">Cleaning System</span> </strong>features <strong>disposable scrub pads</strong> that comes <strong>preloaded with germ-killing cleaner</strong> formula.</span></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">It was designed for people who have icky relationships with their toilets. It is hygienic, effective, and convenient. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-54a9e93c-7fff-0d11-3fc1-ce4f056c32d5\"></b></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&bull; Product description:</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Mainly used for toilet cleaning. Due to its non-abrasive material, it can also be used for ceramic tiles, glass, bathtubs, sinks and other surfaces.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Toilet Cleaning System:&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">1 Wanda Stick&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">1 Wanda Storage Caddy</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">8 Original Wanda Disposable Refills that kill 99.9% of germs*</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Disposable Scrub Pads:&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">These scrub pad refill heads click onto the stick to swish, scrub and clean the toilet bowl and conveniently pop off to throw in the trash.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Disinfecting Cleaner:</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Preloaded with cleaner, these disposable scrubbing pads deep clean and remove dirt and grime while eliminating germs* to make your toilet bowl feel like fresh and clean</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Bathroom Cleaning Products:&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Eliminate the need to store a dirty, germ-ridden toilet brush with the convenient caddy that stores your toilet stick and refill heads for an all-in-1 bathroom household cleaner</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Scrub Pad:</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">The hexagon shaped scrub pads can be rotated 360 degrees for complete cleaning. Clean in hard to reach places under the bowl rim and drain.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">*Based on SGS lab results, 2019.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">The problem with traditional brushes is that they are prone to trapping hair, debris, and other unmentionables. While (silicone) rubber ones are prone to growing mould after some time. And these are just the things that you can&nbsp;<em>see</em>.<br><br>The Wanda Toilet Cleaning System features disposable scrub pads that are pre-loaded with germ killing formula, which gives even better value making them cost efficient too!</span></p>",
